  "notes": "SBP EasyData API, Bank Floating Daily Average Exchange Rates (PKR per National Currency). 23 daily series, PAK Rupees per one unit of the currency, one row per series per date (long format; currency_code identifies the series). Re-queryable, but SBP may revise or remove data without notice, so each run's raw responses are kept (append_only_snapshot); revisions and status-only changes against the previous run are logged as warnings. Dates are working days, plus four Saturdays (2019-08-17, 2022-04-16, 2022-04-23, 2022-04-30). Status comments are kept as returned (29 rows carry an unrelated comment about the 1990-91 invasion of Kuwait). Series names have leading dots and spaces removed in processed; interim keeps them as returned. published_at = 10th of the month after observation_date 23:59:59 Asia/Karachi in UTC (basis monthly_release_10th_next_month): the data is disseminated monthly, so backtests see a value up to about 40 days after its date. SBP's daily Weighted Average Customer Exchange Rates are a different series and are not included.",
